DTSTAMP:20260731T111648Z
DTSTART:20260801T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nJo Koy Live LIVE at Gila River Resorts and Casinos
	 Wild Horse Pass\nGet ready for an unforgettable night of laughter as Jo K
	oy brings his high-energy stand-up comedy show to The Showroom at Gila Riv
	er Resorts and Casinos Wild Horse Pass in Chandler\, Arizona on Saturday\,
	 August 1\, 2026. One of the most beloved comedians in the world\, Jo Koy 
	delivers a hilarious\, heartfelt performance that has sold out arenas acro
	ss the globe. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 1\, 2026\nTime: 8:0
	0 PM (Doors open earlier)\nVenue: Gila River Resorts and Casinos Wild Hors
	e Pass (The Showroom)\nAddress: 5040 Wild Horse Pass Blvd\, Chandler\, AZ 
	85226\nAge Requirement: 18+ Event\nParking: Available on-site at the resor
	t \nAbout Jo Koy\nJo Koy is one of today’s premier stand-up comedians\, kn
	own for his hilarious and heartfelt storytelling about his Filipino-Americ
	an family and upbringing. He has sold out arenas worldwide\, released mult
	iple Netflix specials\, and is beloved by millions of fans for his relatab
	le humor and infectious energy. His tours consistently rank among the top-
	grossing comedy tours in the country. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stan
	d-up comedy from one of the world’s top comedians\nHilarious stories about
	 family\, culture\, and everyday life\nAn intimate showroom setting at a w
	orld-class resort casino\nA night of non-stop laughter with a live audienc
	e\nMemorable performances that fans rave about for years\n18+ event at one
	 of the Phoenix area’s premier entertainment venues\n\nVenue Information\n
	Gila River Resorts and Casinos Wild Horse Pass is a premier entertainment 
	destination located at 5040 Wild Horse Pass Blvd in Chandler\, AZ. The Sho
	wroom is an intimate\, state-of-the-art venue offering excellent sightline
	s and top-notch amenities\, making it one of the best places to catch live
	 comedy in the Phoenix metro area. \nTicket Information\nTickets start fro
	m $153. Secure your seats now before they sell out – Jo Koy shows are know
	n to sell out quickly! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post cont
	ains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through
	 our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subj
	ect to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedy
	calendar.com/event/jo-koy-live-live-at-gila-river-resorts-casinos-wild-hor
	se-pass/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
