ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://brookwoodcommunity.org/wp-content/uploads/
 2025/07/2026-Casserole-Delivery-Days-Website-images-03.png
UID:lOCE6GuZwiMhREFH2MS4J
SUMMARY:Brookwood Casserole Delivery Day Grand Parkway - Aug. 14
DTSTAMP:20260731T111649Z
DTSTART:20260814T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:What’s for Dinner? We’ve Got You!\nBrookwood Casserole Delivery
	 Days are here for your August chaos.\n\nPURCHASE YOURS TODAY for Brookwoo
	d Casserole Delivery Days – Grand Parkway Pickup!\nPre-order now and pick 
	up Friday\, August 14 | 5:00–6:30pm📍 Gallery Furniture – 7227 W Grand Pkwy
	 S\, Richmond\, TX 77407 \n\nCitizens at The Brookwood Community™ know Aug
	ust can feel like a marathon of carpools\, college move-ins\, and teacher 
	meet-and-greets. That’s why we’re making life easier—and more delicious—wi
	th Brookwood Casserole Delivery Days! \n✅ Three delicious frozen casserole
	s to choose from✅ Pre-order online\, then swing by and pick up on your way
	 home✅ Serve 2–4 people – perfect for busy weeknights✅ Support adults with
	 disabilities who live and work with purpose at Brookwood \n\n🍴 Your Casse
	role Lineup:\n🥘 Beef & Spinach LasagnaSeasoned beef\, ricotta\, mushrooms\
	, basil\, and penne pasta layered into savory perfection. \n🌮 Fiesta Chick
	en EnchiladaRoasted chicken\, sweet corn\, black beans\, queso fresco\, La
	tin-style red sauce\, and cheese between layers of corn tortillas. \n🐔 Kin
	g Ranch Chicken – we brought back a Brookwood FAVORITE!Texas comfort class
	ic made with tender chicken\, tomatoes\, green chiles\, layered tortillas\
	, and creamy cheesy goodness in every bite. \n\n💵 $35 each | Bulk Order Di
	scounts:\n\nBuy 5+ and save 5% with code: 5CASS\nBuy 10+ and save 10% with
	 code: 10CASS\n\n\nDinner made easy. Purpose made powerful.Thank you for h
	elping change the way the world thinks about adults with disabilities. \n🗓️
	 Want to know where we’ll be next?Visit our Events Calendar for the full s
	chedule of Brookwood Casserole Delivery Days! \n \n\nhttps://brookwoodcomm
	unity.org/event/brookwood-casserole-delivery-day-grand-parkway-aug-14/\n\n
	From Nutcracker Market
URL:https://brookwoodcommunity.org/event/brookwood-casserole-delivery-day-g
	rand-parkway-aug-14/
LOCATION:Brookwood @ Grand Parkway Gallery Furniture\, 7227 West Grand Park
	way\, Richmond\, TX\, 77407\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:nutcracker-market
CATEGORIES:Nutcracker Market
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
