 2025/07/2026-Casserole-Delivery-Days-Website-images-06.png
UID:qTnqPlDLbZsUXBz9loiDo
SUMMARY:Brookwood Casserole Delivery Day Brookshire - Aug. 29
DTSTAMP:20260731T111649Z
DTSTART:20260829T090000Z
DESCRIPTION:Brookwood to Go: Casserole Delivery Days!\nSupport adults with 
	disabilities and enjoy a stress-free dinner.\n\nPURCHASE YOURS TODAY for B
	rookwood Casserole Delivery Days – Brookshire Pickup!\nPre-order now and p
	ick up Saturday\, August 29 | 9:00am-4:30pm📍 The Brookwood Community – 150
	2 FM 1489\, Brookshire\, TX 77423 \n\nBack-to-school chaos? We’ve got dinn
	er covered. \nOur Citizens at The Brookwood Community™ know August can fee
	l like a marathon of carpools\, college move-ins\, and teacher meet-and-gr
	eets. That’s why we’re making life easier—and more delicious—with Brookwoo
	d Casserole Delivery Days! \n✅ Three delicious frozen casseroles to choose
	 from✅ Pre-order online\, then swing by and pick up on your way home✅ Serv
	e 2–4 people – perfect for busy weeknights✅ Support adults with disabiliti
	es who live and work with purpose at Brookwood \n\n🍴 Your Casserole Lineup
	:\n🥘 Beef & Spinach LasagnaSeasoned beef\, ricotta\, mushrooms\, basil\, a
	nd penne pasta layered into savory perfection. \n🌮 Fiesta Chicken Enchilad
	aRoasted chicken\, sweet corn\, black beans\, queso fresco\, Latin-style r
	ed sauce\, and cheese between layers of corn tortillas. \n🐔 King Ranch Chi
	cken – we brought back a Brookwood FAVORITE!Texas comfort classic made wit
	h tender chicken\, tomatoes\, green chiles\, layered tortillas\, and cream
	y cheesy goodness in every bite. \n\n💵 $35 each | Bulk Order Discounts:\n\
	nBuy 5+ and save 5% with code: 5CASS\nBuy 10+ and save 10% with code: 10CA
	SS\n\n\nDinner made easy. Purpose made powerful.Thank you for helping chan
	ge the way the world thinks about adults with disabilities. \n🗓️ Want to kn
	ow where we’ll be next?Visit our Events Calendar for the full schedule of 
	Brookwood Casserole Delivery Days! \n \n\nhttps://brookwoodcommunity.org/e
	vent/brookwood-casserole-delivery-day-brookshire-aug-29/\n\nFrom Nutcracke
	r Market
URL:https://brookwoodcommunity.org/event/brookwood-casserole-delivery-day-b
	rookshire-aug-29/
LOCATION:The Brookwood Café\, 1502 FM 1489\, Brookshire\, TX\, 77423\, Unit
	ed States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:nutcracker-market
CATEGORIES:Nutcracker Market
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT8H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ccs-houston.com/wp
 -content/uploads/2026/06/Event-Launch-Kit-CCS-Card-Show-I-1.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/0
 6/Event-Launch-Kit-CCS-Card-Show-I-1.jpg
UID:RxglJTt41yKzzHIXIht3D
SUMMARY:CCS Card Show I
DTSTAMP:20260731T111649Z
DTSTART:20260829T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:CCS Card Show I — Every Sport. Every TCG. One Floor.\nHouston\,
	 the hobby comes home. For the first time at CCS\, every major sport and e
	very major TCG land under one roof: sports card collectors\, memorabilia h
	unters\, and TCG players moving cards on the same floor\, the way it shoul
	d be. Modern hits to vintage grails\, sealed wax to graded slabs\, raw sin
	gles to game-used pieces. Buy\, sell\, trade\, grade. This is the room. \n
	  \n📅 Date: August 29-30\, 2026 | 10AM – 5PM \n📍 Location: 9700 Bissonnet 
	St\, Unit 1500\, Houston\, TX 77036 \n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking \n  \n🔥 
	Event Highlights 🔥 \n⚾ The Ultimate Sports Card & Memorabilia Marketplace 
	\nExplore vendors dedicated to sports cards\, high-end memorabilia\, and r
	are collectibles from baseball\, football\, basketball\, and more. If you’
	re hunting for a signed rookie card\, vintage set\, or exclusive autograph
	\, this is THE place to level up your collection. \n  \n🃏 Trading Card Gam
	e Extravaganza 🃏 \nWe’re also featuring top TCG vendors offering a treasur
	e trove of Pokémon\, Yu-Gi-Oh!\, Magic: The Gathering\, One Piece\, Lorcan
	a\, and more! Chase that elusive rare pull or build your deck for your nex
	t tournament\, you’ll find the best deals on booster packs\, graded single
	s\, sealed products\, and Japanese imports. \n  \n💼 Vendors Wanted \nGot a
	 table’s worth to move? Guest vendors are welcome at Card Show I. The pers
	on across the table is a fan like you. Claim your spot 👉🏻 https://forms.gle
	/sZdrRxHkEXM69kbN6 \n  \n🏨 Traveling to Houston? Lock In Your Rate\nEnjoy 
	a special rate of $79/night — ****2 Queens at TownePlace Suites\, only 15 
	minutes away from the action! 👉 https://www.marriott.com/event-reservation
	s/reservation-link.mi?id=1767823967549&key=CORP&app=resvlink\n\nhttps://cc
	s-houston.com/events/ccs-card-show-i/\n\nFrom CCS Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/ccs-card-show-i/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ccs-houston
CATEGORIES:CCS Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT31H
END:VEVENT
